00:37:56,129 --> 00:38:02,129
Cohen, adapted from Stephen King's 1974 semi-epistolary novel Carrie.

13
00:41:05,806 --> 00:41:11,806
The film stars Sissy Spacek as Carrie White, a shy teenage girl
who is constantly mocked and bullied at her school.

14
00:44:15,483 --> 00:44:21,483
She later develops the power of telekinesis and uses it
to wreak vengeance on her tormentors.

15
